 "note": "The Genesis Demon-Slayer. Groups s1..s3 are the shards of Black Meteorite (anim `fracture`, driven by the stack's MeteorUntil); `clover` and `bloom` follow the stack's Resonance (anim `resonance`); the renderer is client/relics/item/vu/ds/DemonSlayerVu. Anim kinds `fracture`, `fracture_glow` and `resonance` are read by DsDynamics: fracture = drift along `axis` by `amp` x fracture, a turn of `deg` about z and `rate` about x, a shiver of the same period; fracture_glow = alpha follows the fracture; resonance = scale 1 + amp x resonance and alpha lerp(min, max, resonance / 4) pulsing faster with it."
}
